<title>USA: Honolulu, Hawaii, $100 mln GO bonds not repriced.</title>
<headline>Honolulu, Hawaii, $100 mln GO bonds not repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
